            ['start_time' => 382.98, 'end_time' => 387.86, 'target_text' => 'understanding the invitation process as well and understanding who Allah subhanahu ta\'ala is.', 'source_text' => 'ialah kefahaman tentang proses seruan jemputan itu sendiri serta kefahaman mengenai siapa sebenarnya Allah Subhanahu wa Ta\'ala.', 'order' => 76],
            ['start_time' => 387.86, 'end_time' => 395.22, 'target_text' => 'It is the only Surat where you find several verses in Ayat, which are back to back consecutive.', 'source_text' => 'Ia adalah satu-satunya surah di mana anda mendapati beberapa ayat suci yang tersusun berturut-turut,', 'order' => 77],
            ['start_time' => 395.22, 'end_time' => 399.06, 'target_text' => 'Each Ayat ends with two names from the names of Allah subhanahu ta\'ala.', 'source_text' => 'di mana setiap ayat diakhiri dengan dua nama yang agung daripada Asma\'ul Husna Allah Subhanahu wa Ta\'ala.', 'order' => 78],
            ['start_time' => 399.06, 'end_time' => 403.14, 'target_text' => 'To remind you that every step of the way during this invitation process, every state,', 'source_text' => 'Bagi mengingatkan anda bahawa dalam setiap langkah di sepanjang proses seruan jemputan ini, pada setiap keadaan,', 'order' => 79],
            ['start_time' => 403.86, 'end_time' => 406.82, 'target_text' => 'you are living with Allah subhanahu ta\'ala before you even arrive at Haj.', 'source_text' => 'jiwa anda sentiasa hidup bersama Allah Subhanahu wa Ta\'ala bahkan sebelum anda tiba di tanah suci haji lagi.', 'order' => 80],
            ['start_time' => 406.82, 'end_time' => 410.26, 'target_text' => 'Now, starting from the statement of Allah subhanahu ta\'ala,', 'source_text' => 'Bermula daripada firman Allah Subhanahu wa Ta\'ala,', 'order' => 81],
            ['start_time' => 440.26, 'end_time' => 441.62, 'target_text' => 'this is where you need to draw through the invitation process.', 'source_text' => 'inilah laluan yang perlu anda hayati sepanjang proses seruan jemputan,', 'order' => 82],
            ['start_time' => 441.62, 'end_time' => 463.62, 'target_text' => 'This is where you need to draw through the invitation process and the journey of Haj.', 'source_text' => 'inilah laluan yang perlu anda telusuri sepanjang proses jemputan dan perjalanan ibadah haji.', 'order' => 83],
            ['start_time' => 463.62, 'end_time' => 466.98, 'target_text' => 'If I can add to that, that\'s like a beautiful insight,', 'source_text' => 'Jika saya boleh menambah pandangan itu, ia adalah suatu huraian yang sungguh indah,', 'order' => 84],
            ['start_time' => 466.98, 'end_time' => 472.9, 'target_text' => 'Master Allah, but if we reflect over the surah that came before Surat al-Haj,', 'source_text' => 'masya-Allah, tetapi jika kita menghayati surah yang hadir sebelum Surah Al-Hajj,', 'order' => 85],
            ['start_time' => 472.9, 'end_time' => 478.34, 'target_text' => 'they are Surat al-Ambi\'ala. So, Allah, you realize that when you read Surat al-Ambi\'ala,', 'source_text' => 'iaitu Surah Al-Anbiya\'. Subhanallah, anda akan menyedari bahawa tatkala membaca Surah Al-Anbiya\',', 'order' => 86],
            ['start_time' => 478.34, 'end_time' => 481.86, 'target_text' => 'and you\'re reading about the many different prophets that Allah has always mentioned.', 'source_text' => 'anda sedang membaca mengenai pelbagai nabi dan rasul yang Allah sebutkan kisah mereka.', 'order' => 87],
            ['start_time' => 481.86, 'end_time' => 495.38, 'target_text' => 'And Allah has always described them, such as Waqah and Ulanah.', 'source_text' => 'Dan Allah sentiasa menyifatkan keperibadian mereka, seperti firman-Nya:', 'order' => 88],
            ['start_time' => 495.38, 'end_time' => 503.22, 'target_text' => 'He says, in the Homena Sahdi, in the Homena Sahdi, in the Homena Sahdi,', 'source_text' => 'Dia berfirman: "Innahum kaanu lanaa \'aabideen, innahum kaanu minas-saaliheen,"', 'order' => 89],
            ['start_time' => 503.22, 'end_time' => 508.74, 'target_text' => 'in Allah\'s version, describes them with these huge characteristics.', 'source_text' => 'di mana Allah \'Azza wa Jall menggambarkan para nabi dengan sifat-sifat kemuliaan yang amat tinggi.', 'order' => 90],
            ['start_time' => 508.74, 'end_time' => 511.46, 'target_text' => 'They were from the submissive Humble ones to us.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka tergolong dalam kalangan hamba yang tunduk patuh dan merendah diri kepada Kami.', 'order' => 91],
            ['start_time' => 511.46, 'end_time' => 513.54, 'target_text' => 'They were from those who worshiped us.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka tergolong dalam kalangan hamba yang sentiasa beribadah kepada Kami.', 'order' => 92],
            ['start_time' => 513.54, 'end_time' => 515.3, 'target_text' => 'They were from the righteous.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka tergolong dalam kalangan orang-orang yang soleh.', 'order' => 93],
            ['start_time' => 515.3, 'end_time' => 519.14, 'target_text' => 'When you read Surat al-Ambi\'ala, and you\'re reading these different prophets,', 'source_text' => 'Tatkala anda membaca Surah Al-Anbiya\' dan menyelami kisah para nabi ini,', 'order' => 94],
            ['start_time' => 519.14, 'end_time' => 522.9, 'target_text' => 'and how Allah\'s or Ujil has praised them, you feel like you\'re missing out.', 'source_text' => 'serta bagaimana Allah \'Azza wa Jall memuji mereka, anda merasakan betapa kerdilnya diri anda.', 'order' => 95],
            ['start_time' => 522.9, 'end_time' => 526.42, 'target_text' => 'You feel like, how can I be, I mean, I bear the layer of solid hate.', 'source_text' => 'Anda berasa tertanya-tanya: "Bagaimanakah aku boleh tergolong dalam kalangan hamba-hamba Allah yang soleh?', 'order' => 96],
            ['start_time' => 526.42, 'end_time' => 529.62, 'target_text' => 'How can I be from those submissive Humble ones to Allah?', 'source_text' => 'Bagaimanakah aku boleh tergolong dalam kalangan mereka yang tunduk patuh dan khusyuk kepada Allah?', 'order' => 97],
            ['start_time' => 529.62, 'end_time' => 530.82, 'target_text' => 'How can I be from Allah?', 'source_text' => 'Bagaimanakah aku boleh menjadi hamba yang diredhai Allah?"', 'order' => 98],
            ['start_time' => 530.82, 'end_time' => 534.74, 'target_text' => 'So what the Haj came after that, to say, go to Allah.', 'source_text' => 'Lalu Surah Al-Hajj hadir tepat selepasnya seakan menyeru: "Pergilah menyahut seruan Allah!', 'order' => 99],
            ['start_time' => 535.7, 'end_time' => 538.9, 'target_text' => 'Go to Allah, and you\'ll reach that station like these prophets.', 'source_text' => 'Pergilah menuju Allah, nescaya engkau akan mampu mencapai darjat ketakwaan sebagaimana para nabi tersebut."', 'order' => 100],
            ['start_time' => 538.9, 'end_time' => 543.38, 'target_text' => 'And we know that in the Risul-Alah\'ala, he was a lamentions about Masjid al-Hive,', 'source_text' => 'Dan kita mengetahui bahawa Rasulullah ﷺ pernah menyebut mengenai Masjid al-Khaif,', 'order' => 101],
            ['start_time' => 543.38, 'end_time' => 546.18, 'target_text' => 'that 70 prophets prayed there.', 'source_text' => 'bahawa 70 orang nabi pernah bersolat di masjid tersebut.', 'order' => 102],
            ['start_time' => 546.18, 'end_time' => 548.18, 'target_text' => 'So literally, when you go to Allah\'s,', 'source_text' => 'Maka secara hakikinya, apabila anda pergi menunaikan haji,', 'order' => 103],
            ['start_time' => 548.18, 'end_time' => 551.38, 'target_text' => 'you\'re not just following in the legacy of Ibrahim Ali, his son.', 'source_text' => 'anda bukan sekadar menuruti jejak legasi Nabi Ibrahim \'alayhis salam semata-mata.', 'order' => 104],
            ['start_time' => 551.38, 'end_time' => 553.86, 'target_text' => 'Every prophet after him came and did Allah\'s,', 'source_text' => 'Bahkan setiap nabi selepas baginda pernah datang dan menunaikan haji,', 'order' => 105],
            ['start_time' => 553.86, 'end_time' => 556.02, 'target_text' => 'when the Risul-Alah\'ala, he was a lot of Allah\'s there.', 'source_text' => 'dan Rasulullah ﷺ sendiri pernah beribadah di sana.', 'order' => 106],
            ['start_time' => 556.02, 'end_time' => 558.82, 'target_text' => 'So it is an honor that a person feels.', 'source_text' => 'Maka ia merupakan suatu kemuliaan yang dirasai oleh seseorang insan.', 'order' => 107],
            ['start_time' => 558.82, 'end_time' => 562.26, 'target_text' => 'When he goes to Allah\'s, and he responds to this invitation,', 'source_text' => 'Apabila dia melangkah menunaikan haji, dan menyahut seruan jemputan ini,', 'order' => 108],
            ['start_time' => 562.26, 'end_time' => 564.02, 'target_text' => 'and does his best to go to Allah\'s,', 'source_text' => 'serta berusaha sedaya upayanya untuk sampai ke sana,', 'order' => 109],
            ['start_time' => 564.82, 'end_time' => 568.26, 'target_text' => 'this is the path to become like those prophets,', 'source_text' => 'inilah jalan untuk mencontohi keperibadian para nabi tersebut,', 'order' => 110],
            ['start_time' => 568.26, 'end_time' => 573.7, 'target_text' => 'and to earn those titles, al-Harsha, Al-Aiabid and so on.', 'source_text' => 'dan meraih gelaran kemuliaan seperti hamba yang khusyuk, hamba yang tekun beribadah dan sebagainya.', 'order' => 111],
            ['start_time' => 573.7, 'end_time' => 574.98, 'target_text' => 'So how do Allah hear?', 'source_text' => 'Maka bagaimanakah cara kita menghayati perkara ini?', 'order' => 112],
            ['start_time' => 574.98, 'end_time' => 579.38, 'target_text' => 'There\'s an incredible link between Surat al-Ambiah or Surat al-Harsha.', 'source_text' => 'Terdapat kaitan yang sungguh luar biasa antara Surah Al-Anbiya\' dan Surah Al-Hajj.', 'order' => 113],
            ['start_time' => 579.38, 'end_time' => 580.34, 'target_text' => 'Now, somehow.', 'source_text' => 'Maha Suci Allah.', 'order' => 114],
            ['start_time' => 580.34, 'end_time' => 582.74, 'target_text' => 'You know, what do you have to say to someone', 'source_text' => 'Anda tahu, apakah yang perlu anda katakan kepada seseorang', 'order' => 115],
            ['start_time' => 582.74, 'end_time' => 587.3, 'target_text' => 'who will tell you that I haven\'t been invited?', 'source_text' => 'yang memberitahu anda bahawa dirinya belum dijemput?', 'order' => 116],
            ['start_time' => 587.3, 'end_time' => 590.58, 'target_text' => 'You know, when you tell them, Allah has invited people to go for Hajan,', 'source_text' => 'Apabila anda memberitahunya bahawa Allah telah menjemput manusia untuk pergi haji,', 'order' => 117],
            ['start_time' => 590.58, 'end_time' => 592.26, 'target_text' => 'they just sit back and say,', 'source_text' => 'mereka hanya berpeluk tubuh dan berkata:', 'order' => 118],
            ['start_time' => 592.26, 'end_time' => 593.54, 'target_text' => 'well, I haven\'t been invited.', 'source_text' => '"Saya belum dijemput lagi."', 'order' => 119],
            ['start_time' => 593.54, 'end_time' => 595.14, 'target_text' => 'What would you say to someone like that?', 'source_text' => 'Apakah kata-kata yang wajar anda berikan kepada orang sebegini?', 'order' => 120],
            ['start_time' => 595.14, 'end_time' => 596.74, 'target_text' => 'Surat al-Alah, we say,', 'source_text' => 'Maha Suci Allah, kita katakan:', 'order' => 121],
            ['start_time' => 596.74, 'end_time' => 599.14, 'target_text' => 'brother, everything starts with an intention.', 'source_text' => '"Wahai saudaraku, setiap amalan itu bermula dengan niat."', 'order' => 122],
            ['start_time' => 600.02, 'end_time' => 603.22, 'target_text' => 'In 10, and be honest and sincere, your intention.', 'source_text' => 'Berniatlah, dan bersikap jujur serta ikhlaslah dalam niatmu itu.', 'order' => 123],
            ['start_time' => 603.22, 'end_time' => 604.42, 'target_text' => 'After the reason of Allah,', 'source_text' => 'Kerana Rasulullah ﷺ,', 'order' => 124],
            ['start_time' => 604.42, 'end_time' => 606.1, 'target_text' => 'Allah, he has said to us,', 'source_text' => 'semoga selawat dan salam ke atas baginda, telah bersabda kepada kita:', 'order' => 125],
            ['start_time' => 606.1, 'end_time' => 608.5, 'target_text' => 'man, Harajam in Bati, he really will Haj.', 'source_text' => '"Barang siapa yang keluar dari rumahnya dengan niat untuk menunaikan haji,', 'order' => 126],
            ['start_time' => 609.54, 'end_time' => 612.26, 'target_text' => 'Anyone who intended to do Al-Haj,', 'source_text' => 'sesiapa sahaja yang benar-benar berniat untuk menunaikan haji,', 'order' => 127],
            ['start_time' => 612.26, 'end_time' => 614.9, 'target_text' => 'and did the works, he did the effort,', 'source_text' => 'lalu dia melakukan usaha persediaan, berusaha sedaya upaya,', 'order' => 128],
            ['start_time' => 614.9, 'end_time' => 618.1, 'target_text' => 'put the visa process and whatever it is for the Haj.', 'source_text' => 'memohon visa dan menguruskan apa jua keperluan untuk haji tersebut,', 'order' => 129],
            ['start_time' => 618.1, 'end_time' => 619.46, 'target_text' => 'And then he died.', 'source_text' => 'kemudian dia ditakdirkan meninggal dunia sebelum sempat sampai,', 'order' => 130],
            ['start_time' => 619.46, 'end_time' => 621.22, 'target_text' => 'He didn\'t reach Al-Haj.', 'source_text' => 'dia tidak sempat tiba di tanah suci untuk berhaji,', 'order' => 131],
            ['start_time' => 621.22, 'end_time' => 623.14, 'target_text' => 'Could be Allah, who was your will Haj?', 'source_text' => 'nescaya Allah tetap mencatatkan baginya ganjaran pahala haji yang sempurna!"', 'order' => 132],
            ['start_time' => 623.14, 'end_time' => 625.54, 'target_text' => 'It has been recorded and written for him, Al-Haj.', 'source_text' => 'Ia telah pun dicatat dan ditulis untuknya pahala ibadah haji.', 'order' => 133],
            ['start_time' => 625.54, 'end_time' => 628.66, 'target_text' => 'That\'s a hand. Likewise, an al-Haj, an al-Haj,', 'source_text' => 'Itu adalah satu jaminan yang sahih. Begitu juga bagi umrah,', 'order' => 134],
            ['start_time' => 628.66, 'end_time' => 630.5, 'target_text' => 'or was mentioned in the same Hadeef.', 'source_text' => 'turut disebutkan dalam hadis yang sama.', 'order' => 135],
            ['start_time' => 630.5, 'end_time' => 632.26, 'target_text' => 'So, the Hadeef is teaching us that,', 'source_text' => 'Maka hadis ini mengajarkan kepada kita bahawa,', 'order' => 136],
            ['start_time' => 632.26, 'end_time' => 635.7, 'target_text' => 'if a person had a sincere and honest intention,', 'source_text' => 'sekiranya seseorang memiliki niat yang tulus dan jujur,', 'order' => 137],
            ['start_time' => 635.7, 'end_time' => 639.3, 'target_text' => 'and then an obstruction happened between him and his intention,', 'source_text' => 'kemudian berlakunya sesuatu halangan yang membataskan antara dirinya dengan niat tersebut,', 'order' => 138],
            ['start_time' => 639.3, 'end_time' => 640.82, 'target_text' => 'Allah has sojal would accept,', 'source_text' => 'Allah \'Azza wa Jall tetap akan menerima amalannya,', 'order' => 139],
            ['start_time' => 640.82, 'end_time' => 643.14, 'target_text' => 'and would reward him according to his intention.', 'source_text' => 'dan akan mengganjarinya setimpal dengan niatnya yang ikhlas.', 'order' => 140],
            ['start_time' => 643.14, 'end_time' => 645.78, 'target_text' => 'But we need to resency and honesty in those intentions.', 'source_text' => 'Namun kita memerlukan keikhlasan dan kejujuran yang hakiki dalam niat tersebut.', 'order' => 141],
            ['start_time' => 645.78, 'end_time' => 647.38, 'target_text' => 'So, there needs to be efforts', 'source_text' => 'Oleh itu, perlu ada usaha yang nyata', 'order' => 142],
            ['start_time' => 647.38, 'end_time' => 650.18, 'target_text' => 'that are followed through after the intention.', 'source_text' => 'yang menyusuli selepas niat itu dilafazkan.', 'order' => 143],
            ['start_time' => 650.26, 'end_time' => 653.86, 'target_text' => 'So, we shouldn\'t look at the issue of invitation', 'source_text' => 'Maka kita tidak wajar memandang isu seruan jemputan ini', 'order' => 144],
            ['start_time' => 653.86, 'end_time' => 656.58, 'target_text' => 'and become despondent, rather, we should make the effort.', 'source_text' => 'sehingga menjadi putus asa, sebaliknya kita mestilah melipatgandakan usaha.', 'order' => 145],
            ['start_time' => 657.38, 'end_time' => 660.42, 'target_text' => 'And insha Allah, because it\'s very tricky to sit.', 'source_text' => 'Dan insya-Allah, kerana amat berbahaya jika kita hanya duduk berdiam diri.', 'order' => 146],
            ['start_time' => 660.42, 'end_time' => 664.02, 'target_text' => 'We don\'t know whether Allah has written for us Haj or not.', 'source_text' => 'Kita sememangnya tidak tahu sama ada Allah telah menetapkan takdir haji untuk kita atau belum.', 'order' => 147],
            ['start_time' => 664.66, 'end_time' => 667.22, 'target_text' => 'But you have to make an effort.', 'source_text' => 'Namun anda diwajibkan untuk berusaha.', 'order' => 148],
            ['start_time' => 667.22, 'end_time' => 668.82, 'target_text' => 'It\'s for example, a person who', 'source_text' => 'Ia laksana seseorang yang', 'order' => 149],
            ['start_time' => 669.7, 'end_time' => 672.58, 'target_text' => 'Allah has not written sustenance for them, right?', 'source_text' => 'belum mengetahui rezeki yang Allah tetapkan untuk dirinya, bukan?', 'order' => 150],
            ['start_time' => 672.58, 'end_time' => 675.3, 'target_text' => 'For example, if they are going to sit', 'source_text' => 'Sebagai contoh, sekiranya mereka hanya duduk berpeluk tubuh', 'order' => 151],
            ['start_time' => 675.3, 'end_time' => 678.02, 'target_text' => 'and not do anything about it at all,', 'source_text' => 'dan tidak melakukan apa-apa usaha langsung untuk mencari nafkah,', 'order' => 152],
            ['start_time' => 678.02, 'end_time' => 680.26, 'target_text' => 'given the capacity, Allah has given them,', 'source_text' => 'sedangkan Allah telah mengurniakan mereka kudrat dan kemampuan,', 'order' => 153],
            ['start_time' => 680.26, 'end_time' => 681.78, 'target_text' => 'then they would be to blame.', 'source_text' => 'maka mereka sendirilah yang patut dipersalahkan.', 'order' => 154],
            ['start_time' => 681.78, 'end_time' => 685.54, 'target_text' => 'So, perhaps that writing is connected to their laziness as well.', 'source_text' => 'Mungkin ketetapan sempitnya rezeki itu berkait rapat dengan sifat malas mereka sendiri.', 'order' => 155],
            ['start_time' => 685.54, 'end_time' => 687.7, 'target_text' => 'So, similarly, when it comes to the Haj,', 'source_text' => 'Maka begitulah halnya dalam urusan ibadah haji,', 'order' => 156],
            ['start_time' => 687.7, 'end_time' => 688.58, 'target_text' => 'if a person is going to say,', 'source_text' => 'sekiranya seseorang sekadar berkata:', 'order' => 157],
            ['start_time' => 688.58, 'end_time' => 689.3, 'target_text' => 'well, look, you know what?', 'source_text' => '"Tengoklah nanti, anda tahu tak,', 'order' => 158],
            ['start_time' => 689.3, 'end_time' => 691.06, 'target_text' => 'I don\'t even know if it\'s written or not.', 'source_text' => 'saya sendiri tidak tahu sama ada ia telah ditakdirkan untuk saya atau tidak.', 'order' => 159],
            ['start_time' => 691.06, 'end_time' => 692.5, 'target_text' => 'I\'m just going to sit and wait and see', 'source_text' => 'Saya hanya mahu duduk menunggu dan melihat,', 'order' => 160],
            ['start_time' => 692.5, 'end_time' => 695.22, 'target_text' => 'if Allah has written, invited me,', 'source_text' => 'sekiranya Allah telah menetapkan dan menjemput saya,', 'order' => 161],
            ['start_time' => 695.22, 'end_time' => 697.62, 'target_text' => 'he will take me there by hook or crook.', 'source_text' => 'Dia pasti akan membawa saya ke sana walau dengan apa cara sekalipun."', 'order' => 162],
            ['start_time' => 697.62, 'end_time' => 698.9, 'target_text' => 'But that\'s not how it works.', 'source_text' => 'Namun hakikatnya sistem Ilahi tidak beroperasi secara pasif sedemikian.', 'order' => 163],
            ['start_time' => 698.9, 'end_time' => 701.54, 'target_text' => 'Like you say, the intention, the effort,', 'source_text' => 'Sebagaimana yang anda katakan: mulakan dengan niat, ikuti dengan usaha,', 'order' => 164],
            ['start_time' => 701.54, 'end_time' => 702.5, 'target_text' => 'work towards it,', 'source_text' => 'bekerjalah ke arah matlamat tersebut,', 'order' => 165],
            ['start_time' => 703.22, 'end_time' => 705.46, 'target_text' => 'forget about whether there was an invitation', 'source_text' => 'lupakan persoalan sama ada seruan itu telah tiba atau belum,', 'order' => 166],
            ['start_time' => 705.46, 'end_time' => 708.26, 'target_text' => 'or Allah will then give it acceptance.', 'source_text' => 'sebaliknya yakinlah bahawa Allah kelak yang akan mengurniakan penerimaan.', 'order' => 167],
            ['start_time' => 708.26, 'end_time' => 710.1, 'target_text' => 'I don\'t know what happened.', 'source_text' => 'Saya tidak tahu apa yang telah berlaku di alam ghaib terdahulu,', 'order' => 168],
            ['start_time' => 710.1, 'end_time' => 712.02, 'target_text' => 'And I don\'t know what is going to happen.', 'source_text' => 'dan saya tidak tahu apa yang bakal terjadi pada masa hadapan.', 'order' => 169],
            ['start_time' => 712.02, 'end_time' => 713.46, 'target_text' => 'I have very limited knowledge.', 'source_text' => 'Pengetahuan saya sebagai manusia amatlah terbatas.', 'order' => 170],
            ['start_time' => 714.26, 'end_time' => 717.06, 'target_text' => 'What the past, I\'m only told by revelation.', 'source_text' => 'Mengenai masa lalu, saya hanya mengetahuinya melalui perkhabaran wahyu.', 'order' => 171],
