            ['start_time' => 833.06, 'end_time' => 835.14, 'target_text' => 'Allah, the terms of finances.', 'source_text' => 'Maksudnya dari sudut kewangan.', 'order' => 227],
            ['start_time' => 835.14, 'end_time' => 836.02, 'target_text' => 'And so, I\'m salute.', 'source_text' => 'Dan sungguh, saya amat tabik dan kagum.', 'order' => 228],
            ['start_time' => 836.02, 'end_time' => 838.5, 'target_text' => 'Which shows that Allah Subhanahu wa ta\'ala has seen within their hearts.', 'source_text' => 'Ini membuktikan bahawa Allah Subhanahu wa Ta\'ala telah melihat ketulusan di dalam hati mereka.', 'order' => 229],
            ['start_time' => 838.5, 'end_time' => 839.22, 'target_text' => 'Great moment.', 'source_text' => 'Detik yang sungguh mengagumkan.', 'order' => 230],
            ['start_time' => 839.22, 'end_time' => 840.5, 'target_text' => 'I just wanted to add that point.', 'source_text' => 'Saya cuma ingin menambah perkara tersebut.', 'order' => 231],
            ['start_time' => 840.5, 'end_time' => 841.54, 'target_text' => 'You know, he brings us up.', 'source_text' => 'Anda tahu, beliau membangkitkan perkara ini.', 'order' => 232],
            ['start_time' => 841.54, 'end_time' => 843.22, 'target_text' => 'That is such a powerful point.', 'source_text' => 'Itu adalah satu hujah yang sangat mendalam dan bermakna.', 'order' => 233],
            ['start_time' => 843.22, 'end_time' => 845.54, 'target_text' => 'Because if you go for Hajj and anyone who\'s been for Hajj', 'source_text' => 'Kerana jika anda pergi berhaji dan sesiapa sahaja yang pernah ke sana', 'order' => 234],
            ['start_time' => 845.54, 'end_time' => 850.34, 'target_text' => 'would definitely notice that the bulk of them are people who\'ve saved up for years.', 'source_text' => 'pasti akan menyedari bahawa sebahagian besar daripada mereka adalah orang yang menabung bertahun-tahun.', 'order' => 235],
            ['start_time' => 851.06, 'end_time' => 852.26, 'target_text' => 'And they focus.', 'source_text' => 'Dan mereka sangat fokus.', 'order' => 236],
            ['start_time' => 852.26, 'end_time' => 855.06, 'target_text' => 'So, this Hajj, because Allah accepted them one whole time.', 'source_text' => 'Maka, haji ini bermakna, kerana Allah telah menerima mereka sekali seumur hidup.', 'order' => 237],
            ['start_time' => 855.06, 'end_time' => 857.38, 'target_text' => 'They understood the invitation.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka benar-benar memahami jemputan itu.', 'order' => 238],
            ['start_time' => 857.38, 'end_time' => 860.42, 'target_text' => 'They knew the assignment as they saved.', 'source_text' => 'Mereka tahu amanah dan matlamat mereka tatkala mereka menabung.', 'order' => 239],
            ['start_time' => 860.42, 'end_time' => 864.18, 'target_text' => 'And they actually worked towards the people coming from Far East Asia.', 'source_text' => 'Dan mereka berusaha gigih mencapainya, seperti orang-orang dari Asia Timur Jauh.', 'order' => 240],
            ['start_time' => 864.18, 'end_time' => 866.1, 'target_text' => 'Just as an example, from Nigeria.', 'source_text' => 'Sebagai contoh lain, jemaah dari Nigeria.', 'order' => 241],
            ['start_time' => 866.1, 'end_time' => 868.98, 'target_text' => 'So, they save for more decades.', 'source_text' => 'Maka, mereka menabung selama berdekad-dekad.', 'order' => 242],
            ['start_time' => 869.94, 'end_time' => 874.42, 'target_text' => 'And they keep saving and I spoke into one of the elderly people once.', 'source_text' => 'Dan mereka terus menabung, dan saya pernah berbual dengan salah seorang warga emas.', 'order' => 243],
            ['start_time' => 874.42, 'end_time' => 879.94, 'target_text' => 'And he told me that inflation kept depleting the amount that I had on the one.', 'source_text' => 'Dan beliau memberitahu saya bahawa inflasi sentiasa mengurangkan nilai wang simpanan yang beliau ada.', 'order' => 244],
            ['start_time' => 879.94, 'end_time' => 885.94, 'target_text' => 'Can you imagine if you were told that you need 20,000 in your currency to go for Hajj?', 'source_text' => 'Bolehkah anda bayangkan jika diberitahu bahawa anda memerlukan 20,000 dalam mata wang anda untuk menunaikan haji?', 'order' => 245],
            ['start_time' => 885.94, 'end_time' => 888.58, 'target_text' => 'You started saving a thousand a year.', 'source_text' => 'Anda mula menyimpan seribu setahun.', 'order' => 246],
            ['start_time' => 889.54, 'end_time' => 892.34, 'target_text' => 'In 20 years, you save 20,000.', 'source_text' => 'Dalam tempoh 20 tahun, anda berjaya mengumpul 20,000.', 'order' => 247],
            ['start_time' => 892.34, 'end_time' => 897.46, 'target_text' => 'The problem is with the inflation globally, and especially in the third world countries,', 'source_text' => 'Masalahnya dengan inflasi di seluruh dunia, dan terutamanya di negara-negara dunia ketiga,', 'order' => 248],
            ['start_time' => 897.46, 'end_time' => 900.5, 'target_text' => 'by the time the year passes, it\'s 25,000.', 'source_text' => 'apabila masa berlalu, kosnya telah meningkat kepada 25,000.', 'order' => 249],
            ['start_time' => 901.22, 'end_time' => 903.38, 'target_text' => 'It then goes to 30,000.', 'source_text' => 'Kemudian ia meningkat lagi kepada 30,000.', 'order' => 250],
            ['start_time' => 903.38, 'end_time' => 906.18, 'target_text' => 'You may be able to save 2,000 instead of one.', 'source_text' => 'Anda mungkin mampu menyimpan 2,000 dan bukannya seribu.', 'order' => 251],
            ['start_time' => 906.18, 'end_time' => 907.94, 'target_text' => 'You\'ll be able to save three.', 'source_text' => 'Anda mungkin mampu menyimpan tiga ribu.', 'order' => 252],
            ['start_time' => 907.94, 'end_time' => 910.98, 'target_text' => 'So, you will still cover it within your 20 years.', 'source_text' => 'Maka, anda masih mampu menampungnya dalam tempoh 20 tahun itu.', 'order' => 253],
            ['start_time' => 910.98, 'end_time' => 916.1, 'target_text' => 'But the amount will be much bigger in numbers because of inflation.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi jumlah wang fizikalnya menjadi jauh lebih besar disebabkan oleh inflasi.', 'order' => 254],
            ['start_time' => 916.1, 'end_time' => 918.42, 'target_text' => 'A lot of the third world countries face this crisis.', 'source_text' => 'Banyak negara dunia ketiga menghadapi krisis ini.', 'order' => 255],
            ['start_time' => 918.42, 'end_time' => 920.98, 'target_text' => 'And this is why you see a lot of people.', 'source_text' => 'Dan inilah sebabnya anda melihat ramai orang,', 'order' => 256],
            ['start_time' => 920.98, 'end_time' => 922.98, 'target_text' => 'When you look at them, they see poor people.', 'source_text' => 'apabila anda memandang mereka, orang melihat mereka miskin.', 'order' => 257],
            ['start_time' => 922.98, 'end_time' => 924.98, 'target_text' => 'Allah has invited them for Hajj.', 'source_text' => 'Tetapi Allah telah menjemput mereka untuk menunaikan haji.', 'order' => 258],
            ['start_time' => 925.62, 'end_time' => 928.02, 'target_text' => 'And Allah, as you see, what a powerful point.', 'source_text' => 'Dan demi Allah, seperti yang anda lihat, betapa mendalamnya perkara ini.', 'order' => 259],
            ['start_time' => 928.02, 'end_time' => 929.94, 'target_text' => 'That sometimes the wealthy are not there.', 'source_text' => 'Bahawa ada kalanya orang kaya tidak berada di sana.', 'order' => 260],
            ['start_time' => 929.94, 'end_time' => 931.06, 'target_text' => 'So, HanAllah.', 'source_text' => 'Subhanallah.', 'order' => 261],
            ['start_time' => 931.06, 'end_time' => 931.7, 'target_text' => 'HanAllah.', 'source_text' => 'Maha Suci Allah.', 'order' => 262],
            ['start_time' => 932.5, 'end_time' => 932.9, 'target_text' => 'Incredible.', 'source_text' => 'Luar biasa sekali.', 'order' => 263],
            ['start_time' => 933.7, 'end_time' => 935.22, 'target_text' => 'So, that\'s what it is.', 'source_text' => 'Jadi, itulah hakikatnya.', 'order' => 264],
            ['start_time' => 935.22, 'end_time' => 940.58, 'target_text' => 'It\'s about realizing the seriousness of Hajj.', 'source_text' => 'Ia adalah tentang menyedari betapa besarnya kepentingan ibadah haji.', 'order' => 265],
            ['start_time' => 940.58, 'end_time' => 943.62, 'target_text' => 'And that is, it\'s a pillar of the pillars of Islam.', 'source_text' => 'Dan hakikatnya, ia adalah salah satu rukun daripada rukun-rukun Islam.', 'order' => 266],
            ['start_time' => 943.62, 'end_time' => 946.74, 'target_text' => 'So many people, they relax on this point, thinking that', 'source_text' => 'Ramai orang yang mengambil mudah tentang perkara ini, menyangka bahawa', 'order' => 267],
            ['start_time' => 946.74, 'end_time' => 952.26, 'target_text' => 'an Hajj, or an Omar, is just a journey that you\'re taking by plane to get to Mecca.', 'source_text' => 'haji atau umrah hanyalah satu perjalanan biasa menaiki kapal terbang ke Makkah.', 'order' => 268],
            ['start_time' => 952.26, 'end_time' => 954.42, 'target_text' => 'And then we do whatever everyone does and return.', 'source_text' => 'Dan kemudian kita lakukan apa yang dilakukan oleh semua orang lalu pulang.', 'order' => 269],
            ['start_time' => 955.46, 'end_time' => 958.34, 'target_text' => 'When you understand the seriousness of a Hajj,', 'source_text' => 'Apabila anda memahami betapa agungnya ibadah haji,', 'order' => 270],
            ['start_time' => 958.34, 'end_time' => 959.86, 'target_text' => 'and that it\'s an obligation.', 'source_text' => 'dan bahawa ia adalah satu kewajipan fardu.', 'order' => 271],
            ['start_time' => 959.86, 'end_time' => 963.38, 'target_text' => 'Allah is a result obligated upon mankind.', 'source_text' => 'Allah \'Azza wa Jalla telah mewajibkannya ke atas sekalian manusia.', 'order' => 272],
            ['start_time' => 963.38, 'end_time' => 965.62, 'target_text' => 'And that it\'s a pillar of the pillars of Islam.', 'source_text' => 'Dan bahawa ia merupakan rukun daripada rukun-rukun Islam.', 'order' => 273],
            ['start_time' => 965.62, 'end_time' => 968.26, 'target_text' => 'When you understand it\'s virtue, it\'s reward.', 'source_text' => 'Apabila anda memahami keutamaannya, ganjaran pahalanya.', 'order' => 274],
            ['start_time' => 968.26, 'end_time' => 973.3, 'target_text' => 'These are the factors and the matters that start to put that eagerness into the heart.', 'source_text' => 'Inilah faktor-faktor dan perkara yang menyemai kerinduan mendalam ke dalam hati.', 'order' => 275],
            ['start_time' => 973.3, 'end_time' => 978.18, 'target_text' => 'And a person, you know, basically taking this matter seriously.', 'source_text' => 'Dan seseorang itu, anda tahu, akan mula mengambil berat tentang perkara ini.', 'order' => 276],
